Package: merchandiser
Title: Estimate Log and Product Volumes from Forest Inventory
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Hunter", "Stanke", , "hunter@siskiyoubiometrics.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Estimates log and product volumes from forest inventory.
    Combines stem profiles, height models, biomass equations, product
    specifications, located defects, bucking, and summaries. The National
    Volume Estimator Library supplies the shipped source equations.
